<title>USA: General Dynamics names Mancuso senior V.P.</title>
<headline>General Dynamics names Mancuso senior V.P.</headline>
<dateline>FALLS CHURCH, Va. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Dynamics Corp said it has elected Michael Mancuso as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Mancuso had been vice president and chief financial officer since November 1994. General Dynamics said Mancuso will continue to be responsible for the treasury, accounting, tax and controller functions of the company and will continue to report to Nicholas Chabraja, vice chairman.</p>
</text>
